<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699' }}>04 请拍板</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3864', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>请拍板三件事</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3D4C63' }}>这三项定下来，排期、预算与验收口径才能锁定；其余由项目组按图推进。</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 10, alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 24, background: '#1F3864' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8FA3BF' }}>决策 01</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>分期边界与预算</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D4E4', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>按三期约 109.5 人月立项，P0 先行 43.5 人月</Text>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#3A5480', marginTop: 4, marginBottom: 4 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8FA3BF' }}>建议</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>先批 P0；P1 / P2 按里程碑分批放款</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8FA3BF', marginTop: 4 }}>影响</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#C9D4E4', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>一期不确定的是边界，不是人力；边界一锁，估算即收敛</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 24, background: '#F2F5F9' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699' }}>决策 02</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3864', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>L3 集群上限</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3D4C63', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>把 L3 独立集群上限写进管理办法，目标 ≤ 5 个</Text>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D9DEE7', marginTop: 4, marginBottom: 4 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699' }}>建议</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F3864', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>超出须集团书面审批，并说明不可替代的理由</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', marginTop: 4 }}>影响</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D4C63', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>每多一个 L3，就多 5–8 倍的资源当量与一份运维值班</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 24, background: '#F2F5F9' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699' }}>决策 03</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3864', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>测试投入单列</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3D4C63', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>测试与验证约占 24%，不与其他开发项合并考核</Text>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D9DEE7', marginTop: 4, marginBottom: 4 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699' }}>建议</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#B3261E', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>单独列项、单独验收，含 20 组越权用例</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', marginTop: 4 }}>影响</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D4C63', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>这是“能不能上生产”的唯一凭据，砍了就只剩纸面架构</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', background: '#1F3864', padding: 16, gap: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>结论</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>这三件今天定，本周就能发材料；第 5 周进 P0，节奏由我们按图推进。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699' }}>具体材料清单见《客户交流版》第 19 页（T01 / T09 / T10 / T12 / T20）</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699' }}>07 / 09</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
